    <briefdescription>
<para>Dual-mode retrieval façade implementing the LightRAG pattern. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>AUTO routing heuristic (&lt; 5 ms, no LLM required)</title><para>Classifies as GLOBAL if the query contains any of the following terms (case-insensitive): &quot;gesamte&quot;, &quot;überblick&quot;, &quot;alle&quot;, &quot;prozess&quot;, &quot;ablauf&quot;, &quot;workflow&quot;, &quot;beschreibe&quot;, &quot;erklär&quot;, &quot;summary&quot;, &quot;overview&quot; Otherwise classifies as LOCAL.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>GLOBAL fallback</title><para>If no communities are persisted for the model, GLOBAL falls back to LOCAL and logs a WARN so there is no silent failure.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread safety</title><para>All operations are read-only; thread safety is inherited from the underlying <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_graph_rag" kindref="compound">ProcessGraphRag</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_community_detector" kindref="compound">ProcessCommunityDetector</ref></computeroutput> instances.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_light_retriever_1phase2_stress_hardening">
<title>Phase 2: Stress Scenario Hardening</title><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_light_retriever" kindref="compound">ProcessLightRetriever</ref> now gracefully handles resource constraints:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Bounded Retrieval Depth</bold>: Maximum traversal depth is enforced; if exceeded, retrieval returns partial context with <computeroutput>degraded=true</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Context Size Limits</bold>: If accumulated context exceeds <computeroutput>kMaxContextBytes</computeroutput>, retrieval gracefully truncates and signals <computeroutput>resource_exhaustion_reason</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Timeout Enforcement</bold>: If retrieval exceeds <computeroutput>kMaxRetrievalTimeMs</computeroutput>, returns best-effort partial result.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Element Count Limits</bold>: Parser respects maximum element count; excess elements trigger graceful degradation.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_community_detector" kindref="compound">ProcessCommunityDetector</ref>, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_graph_rag" kindref="compound">ProcessGraphRag</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
